  "manual_steps": [
    "Retopology ran QuadriFlow (automatic quad remesh) on a decimated, repaired proxy of the sculpt. It is not artist retopo: edge loops do not follow facial anatomy or deformation lines. Fine for a static prop, not yet for an animated character.",
